        "text": "A discharge petition requires a majority of House members to force a vote on legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "To succeed with a discharge petition, Republicans must persuade some Democrats to join them.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "No Democrat has signed the discharge petition despite full Republican support.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "When in the minority, the speaker controls the agenda and can block relief measures.",
